      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.61,
      "end_seconds": 147.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.45,
      "end_seconds": 159.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.68,
      "end_seconds": 162.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "no known allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 164.2,
      "end_seconds": 172.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Yeah you know hold on doctor I think she reacted to diclofenac once. I'm not certain though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.94,
      "end_seconds": 175.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.6,
      "end_seconds": 179.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Okay I'll note both of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.47,
      "end_seconds": 190.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.94,
      "end_seconds": 205.21,
      "duration_seconds": 14.27,
      "text": "I've had heart failure, yes. I didn't wanna bother you but it keeps coming back. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.04,
      "end_seconds": 211.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.19,
      "end_seconds": 219.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke. Let me think, uh, my brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.6,
      "end_seconds": 239.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.95,
      "end_seconds": 249.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.48,
      "end_seconds": 268.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "okay: oxygen saturation is 93 percent, pulse 96, BP is 137 over 74, temp 36.7 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.6,
      "end_seconds": 276.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "let me look at the the area I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.61,
      "end_seconds": 280.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.46,
      "end_seconds": 304.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "there are crackles all the way up both lungs and you are breathing very fast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.66,
      "end_seconds": 329.81,
      "duration_seconds": 21.15,
      "text": "So thank you you can get dressed. Taking everything into account I'd lean towards acute pulmonary oedema. We shouldn't forget a severe chest infection. I'd like to arrange an ECG for pulmonary oedema. I'm gonna to order a chest X-ray for pulmonary oedema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.43,
      "end_seconds": 333.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.16,
      "end_seconds": 345.02,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for pulmonary oedema. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.04,
      "end_seconds": 347.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.25,
      "end_seconds": 374.61,
      "duration_seconds": 25.36,
      "text": "I'm prescribing furosemide, 40 milligrams, once now, single dose. It's for fluid on the lungs. Sit upright, I am giving oxygen and a water tablet injection now. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. Let's review you straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.05,
      "end_seconds": 378.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Thank you that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.07,
      "end_seconds": 381.96,
